msgstr "Along the whole view"

#. Accessible name of the list of Google's apps under the Open app search field, read by screen readers
#: src/shell/open-app.tsx
msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Apps"

#. Button on a new email notification that archives the email. Gmail's own word for the action
#: src/main/notifications.ts
msgid "Archive"
msgstr "Archive"

#. Button on a message in the unified inbox that archives it. Gmail's own word for the action
#: src/shell/inbox.tsx
msgctxt "inbox action"
msgid "Archive"
msgstr "Archive"

#. Said by screen readers after a sidebar row's title while its tab sleeps: put to sleep, or not opened yet since Meru started
